sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Java application
    participant JVM as JVM heap
    participant GC as Garbage collector
    participant OS as Linux virtual memory
    participant Phys as Physical RAM
    App->>JVM: allocate an object
    JVM->>JVM: bump the pointer in eden
    alt eden full
        JVM->>GC: minor collection
        GC->>JVM: copy survivors, free the rest
    end
    JVM->>OS: the heap is just mapped virtual memory
    OS->>Phys: back a page on first touch
    Note over OS,Phys: reserved is not committed, and committed is not resident
    alt the cgroup limit is reached
        OS->>App: OOM kill
        Note over App,OS: the JVM sees a healthy heap while the kernel kills the process
    end
